## Example MySQL DATABASE_URL with connection pool and socket timeout settings
## Increase `connection_limit` from 2 -> 10 and `socket_timeout` from 20000ms -> 60000ms
## Note: Some providers expect timeout values in milliseconds.
## Example:
## DATABASE_URL="mysql://user:password@host:3306/dbname?connection_limit=10&socket_timeout=60000"
